=begin pod :kind("Type") :subkind("class") :category("basic")

=TITLE class RakuAST::Name::Part

=SUBTITLE Base class for representing a part of a Name

    class RakuAST::Name::Part { }

The C<RakuAST::Name::Part> class serves as the base class of the basic
functionality of the C<RakuAST::Name::Part::xx> classes, which all
represent a part of a L<C<RakuAST::Name>|/type/RakuAST/Name> object.

These currently are:
=item L<C<RakuAST::Name::Part::Simple>|/type/Name/Part/Simple>
=item L<C<RakuAST::Name::Part::Expression>|/type/Name/Part/Expression>
=item L<C<RakuAST::Name::Part::EmptyEdge>|/type/Name/Part/EmptyEdge>

=end pod
